rol how consumers of your solutions are distributed among the available systems. See Manage Consumer Subscription.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-12-05\nValid as Of: 2025-04-07\nVersion: ABAP Environment 2502\n\n--- Record 1085 ---\nComponent: UI Theme Designer\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Neo\nTitle: Theming Base Content for CF and Neo.\nDescription: The base theming content is updated to version 11.29.0. Review the changes at https://github.com/SAP/theming-base-content/releases.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2025-04-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1086 ---\nComponent: API Management\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Discover and Publish Events from Business Systems on Developer Hub\nDescription: You can now add events discovered from business systems to products and make them publicly available by publishing the associated products on Developer Hub. For more information, see Discover and Publish Events from Business Systems on Developer Hub.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-06\nValid as Of: 2025-04-06\nVersion: 2502\n\n--- Record 1087 ---\nComponent: Cloud Integration\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Neo\nTitle: Append custom parameters to service document call for OData V4 receiver adapter\nDescription: For OData V4 receiver adpater version 1.17 and above, the custom parameters configured for $metadata call will also be appended to the service document call.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-06\nValid as Of: 2025-04-06\nVersion: 2502\n\n--- Record 1088 ---\nComponent: Cloud Integration\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Inspect Total Values of Data Store Usage\nDescription: You can now view the exact values of